    CustomStringTableItem "{3794F00000000008}" {
     Id "LF-Dialogue_AnniversaryMayor_Bye"
     Target_en_us "Till the day, then."
     Comment "The mayor says goodbye (#3794)."
    }
    CustomStringTableItem "{3794F00000000004}" {
     Id "LF-Dialogue_AnniversaryMayor_Day"
     Target_en_us "Three years since the first families walked in from the dark. We lay trestles in the square, we light candles, we say thank you. Everyone remembers that night a little differently, and the town must hold all of it."
     Comment "The mayor explains the anniversary, a thank-you in his telling (#3794)."
    }
    CustomStringTableItem "{3794F00000000006}" {
     Id "LF-Dialogue_AnniversaryMayor_Errand"
     Target_en_us "Then take what the square still lacks, and come back when it is done. I will not forget it."
     Comment "The mayor hands out an errand or thanks the player (#3794)."
    }
    CustomStringTableItem "{3794F00000000002}" {
     Id "LF-Dialogue_AnniversaryMayor_Greet"
     Target_en_us "Ah, a face I do not know yet. Bastien Girard, mayor. Forgive the mess, the whole town is busy with the day."
     Comment "The mayor's greeting at the town hall (#3794)."
    }
    CustomStringTableItem "{3794F00000000003}" {
     Id "LF-Dialogue_AnniversaryMayor_SayAskDay"
     Target_en_us "What is the day for?"
     Comment "Reply: ask the mayor about the anniversary (#3794)."
    }
    CustomStringTableItem "{3794F00000000007}" {
     Id "LF-Dialogue_AnniversaryMayor_SayBye"
     Target_en_us "Another time."
     Comment "Reply: leave the mayor (#3794)."
    }
    CustomStringTableItem "{3794F00000000005}" {
     Id "LF-Dialogue_AnniversaryMayor_SayOffer"
     Target_en_us "Can I help with the preparations?"
     Comment "Reply: take the mayor's errand, or hand in what is done (#3794)."
    }
    CustomStringTableItem "{18255E21BCB0A61B}" {
     Id "LF-Dialogue_AnniversaryPriest_Memorial"
     Target_en_us "Three years ago they walked out of the night with what they could carry. We remember each of them. Stand with us a moment."
     Comment "Dialogue caption, spoken by the anniversary_priest NPC (voiced; tools/assets/dialogue/anniversary_priest). Changing it needs: tools\\cli asset dialogue anniversary_priest"
    }
    CustomStringTableItem "{3E9F5343A58B4851}" {
     Id "LF-Dialogue_CafeOwner_Bye"
     Target_en_us "Come back when you are hungry. Or lonely. It is the same to me."
     Comment "Dialogue caption, spoken by the cafe_owner NPC (voiced; tools/assets/dialogue/cafe_owner). Changing it needs: tools\\cli asset dialogue cafe_owner"
    }
    CustomStringTableItem "{25858095EC3BC26B}" {
     Id "LF-Dialogue_CafeOwner_Clerk"
     Target_en_us "Before anything else, see the town clerk at the desk on the square. He keeps the register. A person who is not in it is no one at all, here."
     Comment "Dialogue caption, spoken by the cafe_owner NPC (voiced; tools/assets/dialogue/cafe_owner). Changing it needs: tools\\cli asset dialogue cafe_owner"
    }
    CustomStringTableItem "{CF6D5EEB9B023A27}" {
     Id "LF-Dialogue_CafeOwner_Greet"
     Target_en_us "Come in, come in. The coffee is hot. You are new here, I can tell. Nobody walks that slowly who has lived here long."
     Comment "Dialogue caption, spoken by the cafe_owner NPC (voiced; tools/assets/dialogue/cafe_owner). Changing it needs: tools\\cli asset dialogue cafe_owner"
    }
    CustomStringTableItem "{7175FAEEC545FB58}" {
     Id "LF-Dialogue_CafeOwner_GreetFriendly"
     Target_en_us "Welcome back! You always bring a smile in with you. What can I do for you?"
     Comment "Dialogue caption, spoken by the cafe_owner NPC (voiced; tools/assets/dialogue/cafe_owner). Changing it needs: tools\\cli asset dialogue cafe_owner"
    }
    CustomStringTableItem "{6F4DC97D37490E2A}" {
     Id "LF-Dialogue_CafeOwner_GreetRefuses"
     Target_en_us "I have nothing to say to you. Please leave my cafe."
     Comment "Dialogue caption, spoken by the cafe_owner NPC (voiced; tools/assets/dialogue/cafe_owner). Changing it needs: tools\\cli asset dialogue cafe_owner"
    }
    CustomStringTableItem "{D147578847F58E39}" {
     Id "LF-Dialogue_CafeOwner_GreetRegular"
     Target_en_us "There is my favorite customer! Sit, sit. Ask me anything."
     Comment "Dialogue caption, spoken by the cafe_owner NPC (voiced; tools/assets/dialogue/cafe_owner). Changing it needs: tools\\cli asset dialogue cafe_owner"
    }
    CustomStringTableItem "{8DFEB7702C93ABF5}" {
     Id "LF-Dialogue_CafeOwner_GreetWary"
     Target_en_us "Oh. It is you. What do you need?"
     Comment "Dialogue caption, spoken by the cafe_owner NPC (voiced; tools/assets/dialogue/cafe_owner). Changing it needs: tools\\cli asset dialogue cafe_owner"
    }
    CustomStringTableItem "{73190CD9164F1A41}" {
     Id "LF-Dialogue_CafeOwner_Handbook"
     Target_en_us "And read the handbook. It is short. It tells you what the town expects of you, and what the police will not forgive."
     Comment "Dialogue caption, spoken by the cafe_owner NPC (voiced; tools/assets/dialogue/cafe_owner). Changing it needs: tools\\cli asset dialogue cafe_owner"
    }
    CustomStringTableItem "{CCB81BA7119C635E}" {
     Id "LF-Dialogue_CafeOwner_Move"
     Target_en_us "When they brought us here, the town did not know what to say. So a neighbor brought bread, and nobody asked a single question. I still use the cups. Every day. Someone has to."
     Comment "Dialogue caption, spoken by the cafe_owner NPC (voiced; tools/assets/dialogue/cafe_owner). Changing it needs: tools\\cli asset dialogue cafe_owner"
    }
    CustomStringTableItem "{02DD35A9A42C5905}" {
     Id "LF-Dialogue_CafeOwner_RumourReported"
     Target_en_us "They say someone carried a crate off the quay straight to the gendarmes. The dockers have not touched a drink here all week. Whoever it was, keep your head down."
     Comment "Dialogue caption, spoken by the cafe_owner NPC (voiced; tools/assets/dialogue/cafe_owner). Changing it needs: tools\\cli asset dialogue cafe_owner"
    }
    CustomStringTableItem "{2198FBE19CD656FD}" {
     Id "LF-Dialogue_CafeOwner_RumourSold"
     Target_en_us "They say a crate went missing off the quay and somebody in town is richer for it. Nobody asks who. The man at the corner table has stopped counting his change."
     Comment "Dialogue caption, spoken by the cafe_owner NPC (voiced; tools/assets/dialogue/cafe_owner). Changing it needs: tools\\cli asset dialogue cafe_owner"
    }
    CustomStringTableItem "{29B0A09C06BED190}" {
     Id "LF-Dialogue_CafeOwner_SayAskClerk"
     Target_en_us "Who should I see first?"
     Comment "Dialogue reply the player can pick when talking to the cafe_owner NPC."
    }
    CustomStringTableItem "{6DCE0D9D87E35551}" {
     Id "LF-Dialogue_CafeOwner_SayAskHandbook"
     Target_en_us "Is there a guide to the town?"
     Comment "Dialogue reply the player can pick when talking to the cafe_owner NPC."
    }
    CustomStringTableItem "{B866FA8A45B03DF1}" {
     Id "LF-Dialogue_CafeOwner_SayAskHelp"
     Target_en_us "Where should I start?"
     Comment "Dialogue reply the player can pick when talking to the cafe_owner NPC."
    }
    CustomStringTableItem "{ABCADE5737CA86E0}" {
     Id "LF-Dialogue_CafeOwner_SayAskMove"
     Target_en_us "What was the move like?"
     Comment "Dialogue reply the player can pick when talking to the cafe_owner NPC."
    }
    CustomStringTableItem "{F6AB13DFF09CF8A6}" {
     Id "LF-Dialogue_CafeOwner_SayAskWork"
     Target_en_us "Where can I find work?"
     Comment "Dialogue reply the player can pick when talking to the cafe_owner NPC."
    }
    CustomStringTableItem "{B0261E2F6F14A07D}" {
     Id "LF-Dialogue_CafeOwner_SayAskZone"
     Target_en_us "Where did you come from?"
     Comment "Dialogue reply the player can pick when talking to the cafe_owner NPC."
    }
    CustomStringTableItem "{206E3B9DD2FBF559}" {
     Id "LF-Dialogue_CafeOwner_SayBye"
     Target_en_us "Goodbye."
     Comment "Dialogue reply the player can pick when talking to the cafe_owner NPC."
    }
    CustomStringTableItem "{A599A26E0012B1F7}" {
     Id "LF-Dialogue_CafeOwner_Work"
     Target_en_us "If you need work, ask at the post office. They always need couriers. Walk fast, keep the parcels dry, and you will be paid by the end of the day."
     Comment "Dialogue caption, spoken by the cafe_owner NPC (voiced; tools/assets/dialogue/cafe_owner). Changing it needs: tools\\cli asset dialogue cafe_owner"
    }
    CustomStringTableItem "{CFA276D036C02296}" {
     Id "LF-Dialogue_CafeOwner_Zone"
     Target_en_us "I came out of the zone. They told us three days. Pack what you can carry, they said, and you will be back by Friday. I took the kettle and my mother's cups. That was three years ago."
     Comment "Dialogue caption, spoken by the cafe_owner NPC (voiced; tools/assets/dialogue/cafe_owner). Changing it needs: tools\\cli asset dialogue cafe_owner"
    }
    CustomStringTableItem "{9BFB48FA2968AE5D}" {
     Id "LF-Dialogue_ClerkEveron_AboutTown"
     Target_en_us "Everon is a small island. People here know each other, and they remember faces. Stay honest and you will do well."
     Comment "Pack patch of the clerk dialogue's line about_town (voiced; tools/assets/dialogue/clerk_everon). Changing it needs: tools\\cli asset dialogue clerk_everon"
    }
    CustomStringTableItem "{BAEB5C5137C78001}" {
     Id "LF-Dialogue_ClerkEveron_AboutWork"
     Target_en_us "Looking for work? Start with the orchard east of town: pick apples, press the juice, sell it at the market. Then open your player menu with F2 and read What to do next. The town board lists the rest."
     Comment "Pack patch of the clerk dialogue's line about_work (voiced; tools/assets/dialogue/clerk_everon). Changing it needs: tools\\cli asset dialogue clerk_everon"
    }
    CustomStringTableItem "{5A8EF27F20337853}" {
     Id "LF-Dialogue_ClerkEveron_Apples"
     Target_en_us "Drive to the orchard east of the town and pick six apples from the trees."
     Comment "Pack patch of the clerk dialogue's line apples (voiced; tools/assets/dialogue/clerk_everon). Changing it needs: tools\\cli asset dialogue clerk_everon"
    }
    CustomStringTableItem "{A44A60B6429DD48D}" {
     Id "LF-Dialogue_ClerkEveron_Bank"
     Target_en_us "You were paid in cash. Cash in a pocket is lost if you die. Money in the bank is not. Deposit some at the cash machine on the bank wall, next to the post office."
     Comment "Pack patch of the clerk dialogue's line bank (voiced; tools/assets/dialogue/clerk_everon). Changing it needs: tools\\cli asset dialogue clerk_everon"
    }
    CustomStringTableItem "{3757518D79703D06}" {
     Id "LF-Dialogue_ClerkEveron_Board"
     Target_en_us "Now read the town board on the square, right beside me. It shows where everything in town is."
     Comment "Pack patch of the clerk dialogue's line board (voiced; tools/assets/dialogue/clerk_everon). Changing it needs: tools\\cli asset dialogue clerk_everon"
    }
    CustomStringTableItem "{BB76D2A54ECDD1AD}" {
     Id "LF-Dialogue_ClerkEveron_Bye"
     Target_en_us "Good day to you."
     Comment "Pack patch of the clerk dialogue's line bye (voiced; tools/assets/dialogue/clerk_everon). Changing it needs: tools\\cli asset dialogue clerk_everon"
    }
    CustomStringTableItem "{F81986CEF21AEB71}" {
     Id "LF-Dialogue_ClerkEveron_Done"
     Target_en_us "Welcome to Everon. Here is something to start you off. The town is yours now. The shops, the car lot, the police station and the organization office are all on the town board."
     Comment "Pack patch of the clerk dialogue's line done (voiced; tools/assets/dialogue/clerk_everon). Changing it needs: tools\\cli asset dialogue clerk_everon"
    }
    CustomStringTableItem "{ED0681FDD3AE4F14}" {
     Id "LF-Dialogue_ClerkEveron_Greet"
     Target_en_us "Good day. This is the town clerk's desk. What can I do for you?"
     Comment "Pack patch of the clerk dialogue's line greet (text only; tools/assets/dialogue/clerk_everon). Changing it needs: tools\\cli asset dialogue clerk_everon"
    }
    CustomStringTableItem "{3265C9EC8FCD5237}" {
     Id "LF-Dialogue_ClerkEveron_Idle"
     Target_en_us "You are settled in. The town board on the square shows the rest: the shops, the car lot, the police station and the organization office."
     Comment "Pack patch of the clerk dialogue's line idle (voiced; tools/assets/dialogue/clerk_everon). Changing it needs: tools\\cli asset dialogue clerk_everon"
    }
    CustomStringTableItem "{9045EF2226240420}" {
     Id "LF-Dialogue_ClerkEveron_Juice"
     Target_en_us "Press your six apples into two bottles of juice at the juice press on the orchard stall."
     Comment "Pack patch of the clerk dialogue's line juice (voiced; tools/assets/dialogue/clerk_everon). Changing it needs: tools\\cli asset dialogue clerk_everon"
    }
    CustomStringTableItem "{B3E611FAB38249E9}" {
     Id "LF-Dialogue_ClerkEveron_Market"
     Target_en_us "Drive back to the market in the town center and sell your apple juice to the trader."
     Comment "Pack patch of the clerk dialogue's line market (voiced; tools/assets/dialogue/clerk_everon). Changing it needs: tools\\cli asset dialogue clerk_everon"
    }
    CustomStringTableItem "{9F23A94BE325937D}" {
     Id "LF-Dialogue_ClerkEveron_Papers"
     Target_en_us "Your papers. Tell me what you need."
     Comment "Pack patch of the clerk dialogue's line papers (voiced; tools/assets/dialogue/clerk_everon). Changing it needs: tools\\cli asset dialogue clerk_everon"
    }
    CustomStringTableItem "{ACA40575917539FA}" {
     Id "LF-Dialogue_ClerkEveron_Register"
     Target_en_us "There. Your name is in the register, and this is your identity card. Keep it on you. The police may ask to see it."
     Comment "Pack patch of the clerk dialogue's line register (voiced; tools/assets/dialogue/clerk_everon). Changing it needs: tools\\cli asset dialogue clerk_everon"
    }
    CustomStringTableItem "{2FC26FA7E5CB2E7E}" {
     Id "LF-Dialogue_ClerkEveron_SayBye"
     Target_en_us "Goodbye."
     Comment "Pack patch reply for the clerk dialogue (tools/assets/dialogue/clerk_everon)."
    }
    CustomStringTableItem "{531F8A96028F39C5}" {
     Id "LF-Dialogue_ClerkEveron_SayGoon"
     Target_en_us "Go on, please."
     Comment "Pack patch reply for the clerk dialogue (tools/assets/dialogue/clerk_everon)."
    }
    CustomStringTableItem "{0DB420D21A350315}" {
     Id "LF-Dialogue_ClerkEveron_SayLost"
     Target_en_us "I have lost my identity card."
     Comment "Pack patch reply for the clerk dialogue (tools/assets/dialogue/clerk_everon)."
    }
    CustomStringTableItem "{3AC37252874BE98F}" {
     Id "LF-Dialogue_ClerkEveron_SayNew"
     Target_en_us "I am new in Everon."
     Comment "Pack patch reply for the clerk dialogue (tools/assets/dialogue/clerk_everon)."
    }
    CustomStringTableItem "{2F6724F43C01C743}" {
     Id "LF-Dialogue_ClerkEveron_SayNext"
     Target_en_us "What should I do now?"
     Comment "Pack patch reply for the clerk dialogue (tools/assets/dialogue/clerk_everon)."
    }
    CustomStringTableItem "{4F445F57EEA164E6}" {
     Id "LF-Dialogue_ClerkEveron_SayPapers"
     Target_en_us "About my papers."
     Comment "Pack patch reply for the clerk dialogue (tools/assets/dialogue/clerk_everon)."
    }
    CustomStringTableItem "{2267C33EA00A76DD}" {
     Id "LF-Dialogue_ClerkEveron_SayReady"
     Target_en_us "I understand. What now?"
     Comment "Pack patch reply for the clerk dialogue (tools/assets/dialogue/clerk_everon)."
    }
    CustomStringTableItem "{66D17BEFEC6D7B97}" {
     Id "LF-Dialogue_ClerkEveron_StarterCar"
     Target_en_us "Your new car waits at the garage counter of the car lot, next to the town hall: take it out there."
     Comment "Pack patch of the clerk dialogue's line starter_car (voiced; tools/assets/dialogue/clerk_everon). Changing it needs: tools\\cli asset dialogue clerk_everon"
    }
    CustomStringTableItem "{B696FB0623B2D98D}" {
     Id "LF-Dialogue_ClerkEveron_WelcomePack"
     Target_en_us "There. Your name is in the register, and this is your identity card. Keep it on you. And here is the welcome pack the town gives every newcomer: bread, a sausage, a bottle of water and some cash to start with."
     Comment "Pack patch of the clerk dialogue's line welcome_pack (voiced; tools/assets/dialogue/clerk_everon). Changing it needs: tools\\cli asset dialogue clerk_everon"
    }
    CustomStringTableItem "{ACD9BE6C92AE3B95}" {
     Id "LF-Dialogue_ClerkEveron_WelcomePapers"
     Target_en_us "Welcome to Everon. First, your papers. Form R-89 is the relocation form, and I will file it under your name. Your identity card comes with it."
     Comment "Pack patch of the clerk dialogue's line welcome_papers (voiced; tools/assets/dialogue/clerk_everon). Changing it needs: tools\\cli asset dialogue clerk_everon"
    }
    CustomStringTableItem "{3C9568D582BE124D}" {
     Id "LF-Dialogue_ClerkEveron_WelcomeRoom"
     Target_en_us "You sleep at the hostel tonight. The dormitory is upstairs, and any free bunk is yours. It is plain, but it is warm."
     Comment "Pack patch of the clerk dialogue's line welcome_room (voiced; tools/assets/dialogue/clerk_everon). Changing it needs: tools\\cli asset dialogue clerk_everon"
    }
    CustomStringTableItem "{001D205C4B5E0B1A}" {
     Id "LF-Dialogue_ClerkEveron_WelcomeTown"
     Target_en_us "The town expects honest work and quiet nights. Greet your neighbors, pay what you owe, and ask the police if you are ever lost."
     Comment "Pack patch of the clerk dialogue's line welcome_town (voiced; tools/assets/dialogue/clerk_everon). Changing it needs: tools\\cli asset dialogue clerk_everon"
    }
    CustomStringTableItem "{B938C64F01A44D1B}" {
     Id "LF-Dialogue_ClerkEveron_WorkErrand"
     Target_en_us "Time to earn your first wages. The post office is down the street. Take courier work at the counter, pick up a parcel, carry it to the drop at the east end of the street, and complete the run."
     Comment "Pack patch of the clerk dialogue's line work_errand (voiced; tools/assets/dialogue/clerk_everon). Changing it needs: tools\\cli asset dialogue clerk_everon"
    }
    CustomStringTableItem "{7BDFAF37D3BDD834}" {
     Id "LF-Dialogue_Dockworker_AboutCargo"
     Target_en_us "Flour, diesel, machine parts. What is in the other crates is the harbor master's business, and he does not share."
     Comment "Dialogue caption, spoken by the dockworker NPC (text only; tools/assets/dialogue/dockworker). Changing it needs: tools\\cli asset dialogue dockworker"
    }
    CustomStringTableItem "{4682C7C311BB4E55}" {
     Id "LF-Dialogue_Dockworker_AboutWork"
     Target_en_us "Ask the harbor master. He hires by the day when a boat comes in, and pays when the boat is empty."
     Comment "Dialogue caption, spoken by the dockworker NPC (text only; tools/assets/dialogue/dockworker). Changing it needs: tools\\cli asset dialogue dockworker"
    }
    CustomStringTableItem "{9522D9D58323D43B}" {
     Id "LF-Dialogue_Dockworker_Bye"
     Target_en_us "Off you go, then."
     Comment "Dialogue caption, spoken by the dockworker NPC (text only; tools/assets/dialogue/dockworker). Changing it needs: tools\\cli asset dialogue dockworker"
    }
    CustomStringTableItem "{08B2BF1FE8852698}" {
     Id "LF-Dialogue_Dockworker_Greet"
     Target_en_us "Mind your feet, the crane swings wide. You want something, or are you just watching us sweat?"
     Comment "Dialogue caption, spoken by the dockworker NPC (text only; tools/assets/dialogue/dockworker). Changing it needs: tools\\cli asset dialogue dockworker"
    }
    CustomStringTableItem "{49995D617FA2989A}" {
     Id "LF-Dialogue_Dockworker_Name"
     Target_en_us "Dockworker"
     Comment "Speaker name above the dialogue caption: a dockworker at the Saint-Philippe harbour during the shipment scene."
    }
    CustomStringTableItem "{5FC37E736C816BA5}" {
     Id "LF-Dialogue_Dockworker_SayBye"
     Target_en_us "I'll leave you to it."
     Comment "Dialogue reply the player can pick when talking to the dockworker NPC."
    }
    CustomStringTableItem "{16C0FB05BC2B9B46}" {
     Id "LF-Dialogue_Dockworker_SayCargo"
     Target_en_us "What came in on the boat?"
     Comment "Dialogue reply the player can pick when talking to the dockworker NPC."
    }
    CustomStringTableItem "{0E7A25E6B31313F7}" {
     Id "LF-Dialogue_Dockworker_SayWork"
     Target_en_us "Any work on the docks?"
     Comment "Dialogue reply the player can pick when talking to the dockworker NPC."
    }
    CustomStringTableItem "{4E29407E130F00C3}" {
     Id "LF-Dialogue_FuelClerk_AboutWhere"
     Target_en_us "This is Everon, friend. One road around the coast, and this is the only fuel in town. Gas at the pumps, maps and snacks in here. The square is just up the street."
     Comment "Dialogue caption, spoken by the fuel_clerk NPC (voiced; tools/assets/dialogue/fuel_clerk). Changing it needs: tools\\cli asset dialogue fuel_clerk"
    }
    CustomStringTableItem "{632BADA7E940D7F6}" {
     Id "LF-Dialogue_Gendarme_AboutWhat"
     Target_en_us "A routine inspection of a shipment. If you saw anything on these docks tonight, the station on the square takes statements."
     Comment "Dialogue caption, spoken by the gendarme NPC (text only; tools/assets/dialogue/gendarme). Changing it needs: tools\\cli asset dialogue gendarme"
    }
    CustomStringTableItem "{AB1C3152CF016882}" {
     Id "LF-Dialogue_Gendarme_Bye"
     Target_en_us "Move along now. Thank you."
     Comment "Dialogue caption, spoken by the gendarme NPC (text only; tools/assets/dialogue/gendarme). Changing it needs: tools\\cli asset dialogue gendarme"
    }
    CustomStringTableItem "{BB548D11A912F53A}" {
     Id "LF-Dialogue_Gendarme_Greet"
     Target_en_us "Police. Stand back from the warehouse, please. This is a police matter."
     Comment "Dialogue caption, spoken by the gendarme NPC (text only; tools/assets/dialogue/gendarme). Changing it needs: tools\\cli asset dialogue gendarme"
    }
    CustomStringTableItem "{1851DF85B4179C76}" {
     Id "LF-Dialogue_Gendarme_Name"
     Target_en_us "Gendarme"
     Comment "Speaker name above the dialogue caption: a gendarme guarding the dock warehouse during the shipment raid."
    }
    CustomStringTableItem "{BB5B2C7FA9F33B11}" {
     Id "LF-Dialogue_Gendarme_SayBye"
     Target_en_us "I am going."
     Comment "Dialogue reply the player can pick when talking to the gendarme NPC."
    }
    CustomStringTableItem "{5E82226A90E19C18}" {
     Id "LF-Dialogue_Gendarme_SayWhat"
     Target_en_us "What is going on here?"
     Comment "Dialogue reply the player can pick when talking to the gendarme NPC."
    }
    CustomStringTableItem "{A5BFE7A72F0C053D}" {
     Id "LF-Dialogue_HarbourMaster_Bye"
     Target_en_us "Mind the edge of the quay."
     Comment "Harbour master caption (#2692): the goodbye."
    }
    CustomStringTableItem "{7E9DDAA8102F7328}" {
     Id "LF-Dialogue_HarbourMaster_ContractBusy"
     Target_en_us "You already have a load on your back. Finish that one first."
     Comment "Dialogue caption, spoken by the harbour_master NPC (voiced; tools/assets/dialogue/harbour_master). Changing it needs: tools\\cli asset dialogue harbour_master"
    }
    CustomStringTableItem "{7EFE04DBAEF1FD6D}" {
     Id "LF-Dialogue_HarbourMaster_ContractCooldown"
     Target_en_us "Not now. Let your arms rest. Come back in a little while."
     Comment "Dialogue caption, spoken by the harbour_master NPC (voiced; tools/assets/dialogue/harbour_master). Changing it needs: tools\\cli asset dialogue harbour_master"
    }
    CustomStringTableItem "{2D047BD4994A439B}" {
     Id "LF-Dialogue_HarbourMaster_ContractRunOpen"
     Target_en_us "You are carrying something already. Deliver it, then we talk."
     Comment "Dialogue caption, spoken by the harbour_master NPC (voiced; tools/assets/dialogue/harbour_master). Changing it needs: tools\\cli asset dialogue harbour_master"
    }
    CustomStringTableItem "{64B76FBB42089C1D}" {
     Id "LF-Dialogue_HarbourMaster_ContractStarted"
     Target_en_us "Good. Crates are on the quay by the crane. Mind the clock, I am watching it."
     Comment "Dialogue caption, spoken by the harbour_master NPC (voiced; tools/assets/dialogue/harbour_master). Changing it needs: tools\\cli asset dialogue harbour_master"
    }
    CustomStringTableItem "{0CAB3606C5E90963}" {
     Id "LF-Dialogue_HarbourMaster_CratesEarly"
     Target_en_us "I keep the big loads for people I know. Come back when the town knows you. Carry a few crates first."
     Comment "Dialogue caption, spoken by the harbour_master NPC (voiced; tools/assets/dialogue/harbour_master). Changing it needs: tools\\cli asset dialogue harbour_master"
    }
    CustomStringTableItem "{1BC2671024BE40DA}" {
     Id "LF-Dialogue_HarbourMaster_CratesOffer"
     Target_en_us "You, I know. I have a load that must be across before the tide turns. Fast work, better money, and I will want it done on time. Do you want it?"
     Comment "Dialogue caption, spoken by the harbour_master NPC (voiced; tools/assets/dialogue/harbour_master). Changing it needs: tools\\cli asset dialogue harbour_master"
    }
    CustomStringTableItem "{A55113E34B39D13E}" {
     Id "LF-Dialogue_HarbourMaster_FirstJob"
     Target_en_us "Crates, mostly. The coaster unloads onto the quay and somebody has to carry them across to the sheds. It pays by the crate, on the spot."
     Comment "Harbour master caption (#2692): the first job, carrying crates from the quay (the parcel run)."
    }
    CustomStringTableItem "{71AC670B32383636}" {
     Id "LF-Dialogue_HarbourMaster_Go"
     Target_en_us "Good. Take a crate from the pile by the crane and carry it where the tag says. Then come back for the next one."
     Comment "Harbour master caption (#2692): how the crate run works."
    }
    CustomStringTableItem "{0C493581129EAF98}" {
     Id "LF-Dialogue_HarbourMaster_Greet"
     Target_en_us "Harbor office. Mind the crane and mind the ropes. What can I do for you?"
     Comment "Harbour master caption (#2692): the greeting."
    }
    CustomStringTableItem "{793B568C770FF5C5}" {
     Id "LF-Dialogue_HarbourMaster_SayAskCrate"
     Target_en_us "Anything odd on the quay today?"
     Comment "Dialogue reply the player can pick when talking to the harbour_master NPC."
    }
    CustomStringTableItem "{31104EFBD559B194}" {
     Id "LF-Dialogue_HarbourMaster_SayAskCrates"
     Target_en_us "Have you got a bigger load?"
     Comment "Dialogue reply the player can pick when talking to the harbour_master NPC."
    }
    CustomStringTableItem "{841D61171005B9D8}" {
     Id "LF-Dialogue_HarbourMaster_SayAskWork"
     Target_en_us "Is there any work on the quay?"
     Comment "Dialogue reply the player can pick when talking to the harbour_master NPC."
    }
    CustomStringTableItem "{329FE33AE5F0B131}" {
     Id "LF-Dialogue_HarbourMaster_SayBye"
     Target_en_us "Goodbye."
     Comment "Dialogue reply the player can pick when talking to the harbour_master NPC."
    }
    CustomStringTableItem "{EF5EE2BB381B5506}" {
     Id "LF-Dialogue_HarbourMaster_SayCount"
     Target_en_us "I will count the crate for you."
     Comment "Dialogue reply the player can pick when talking to the harbour_master NPC."
    }
    CustomStringTableItem "{5644E7F72839DB8C}" {
     Id "LF-Dialogue_HarbourMaster_SayNotNow"
     Target_en_us "Not just now."
     Comment "Dialogue reply the player can pick when talking to the harbour_master NPC."
    }
    CustomStringTableItem "{3DA14485E225D599}" {
     Id "LF-Dialogue_HarbourMaster_SayReported"
     Target_en_us "I took what was in the crate to the police."
     Comment "Dialogue reply the player can pick when talking to the harbour_master NPC."
    }
    CustomStringTableItem "{7A5ECE2E6B6349A6}" {
     Id "LF-Dialogue_HarbourMaster_SaySold"
     Target_en_us "I found a buyer for what was in the crate."
     Comment "Dialogue reply the player can pick when talking to the harbour_master NPC."
    }
    CustomStringTableItem "{DF9EF80D315A7206}" {
     Id "LF-Dialogue_HarbourMaster_SayTakeCrates"
     Target_en_us "I'll take the load."
     Comment "Dialogue reply the player can pick when talking to the harbour_master NPC."
    }
    CustomStringTableItem "{555B8170F5B38060}" {
     Id "LF-Dialogue_HarbourMaster_SayTakeJob"
     Target_en_us "I'll carry the crates."
     Comment "Dialogue reply the player can pick when talking to the harbour_master NPC."
    }
    CustomStringTableItem "{3736E0D6C96857B0}" {
     Id "LF-Dialogue_HarbourMaster_ShipmentAsk"
     Target_en_us "That red crate on the pallet weighs eleven kilos over the manifest. I signed for tinned fish. Would you count it for me?"
     Comment "Dialogue caption, spoken by the harbour_master NPC (voiced; tools/assets/dialogue/harbour_master). Changing it needs: tools\\cli asset dialogue harbour_master"
    }
    CustomStringTableItem "{BC6917D6F28F88CF}" {
     Id "LF-Dialogue_HarbourMaster_ShipmentCount"
     Target_en_us "Open it, count what is in there and come back. If it is only fish, no harm done."
     Comment "Dialogue caption, spoken by the harbour_master NPC (voiced; tools/assets/dialogue/harbour_master). Changing it needs: tools\\cli asset dialogue harbour_master"
    }
    CustomStringTableItem "{126E2D08A174D4AD}" {
     Id "LF-Dialogue_HarbourMaster_ShipmentThanksReport"
     Target_en_us "You took it to the desk. Good. The town will sleep better, whatever the dockers say."
     Comment "Dialogue caption, spoken by the harbour_master NPC (voiced; tools/assets/dialogue/harbour_master). Changing it needs: tools\\cli asset dialogue harbour_master"
    }
    CustomStringTableItem "{61996AD6C64B434C}" {
     Id "LF-Dialogue_HarbourMaster_ShipmentThanksSell"
     Target_en_us "I did not ask where it went. I will not ask. Keep your head down on the quay for a few days."
     Comment "Dialogue caption, spoken by the harbour_master NPC (voiced; tools/assets/dialogue/harbour_master). Changing it needs: tools\\cli asset dialogue harbour_master"
    }
    CustomStringTableItem "{29B583DBF009AF66}" {
     Id "LF-Dialogue_NightShift_AboutMove"
     Target_en_us "They gave us one bus and one suitcase each. The island is quiet, and the quiet is hard at first. But nobody asks you to leave in the middle of dinner."
     Comment "Dialogue caption, spoken by the night_shift NPC (voiced; tools/assets/dialogue/night_shift). Changing it needs: tools\\cli asset dialogue night_shift"
    }
    CustomStringTableItem "{3A926B5A26D83CD5}" {
     Id "LF-Dialogue_NightShift_AboutWork"
     Target_en_us "If you need wages, read the town board on the square. It lists who is hiring. And the clerk's office has a bed upstairs, for the first nights. Ask the clerk."
     Comment "Dialogue caption, spoken by the night_shift NPC (voiced; tools/assets/dialogue/night_shift). Changing it needs: tools\\cli asset dialogue night_shift"
    }
    CustomStringTableItem "{5844A7CD27076B26}" {
     Id "LF-Dialogue_NightShift_AboutZone"
     Target_en_us "I worked near the Zone before they moved us. Twelve kilometers from the reactor. They told us three days. That was three years ago. I still keep my house key."
     Comment "Dialogue caption, spoken by the night_shift NPC (voiced; tools/assets/dialogue/night_shift). Changing it needs: tools\\cli asset dialogue night_shift"
    }
    CustomStringTableItem "{6F1F8D8B72E42914}" {
     Id "LF-Dialogue_NightShift_Bye"
     Target_en_us "Good night. Walk safe."
     Comment "Dialogue caption, spoken by the night_shift NPC (voiced; tools/assets/dialogue/night_shift). Changing it needs: tools\\cli asset dialogue night_shift"
    }
    CustomStringTableItem "{B3BFC4DA71312BAC}" {
     Id "LF-Dialogue_NightShift_Greet"
     Target_en_us "Evening. Or morning, I lose track on nights. You are one of the new families, yes? Sit if you like."
     Comment "Dialogue caption, spoken by the night_shift NPC (voiced; tools/assets/dialogue/night_shift). Changing it needs: tools\\cli asset dialogue night_shift"
    }
    CustomStringTableItem "{CD248C95DC1ABEA0}" {
     Id "LF-Dialogue_NightShift_GreetFriendly"
     Target_en_us "Ah, good evening. Good to see you. Sit if you like."
     Comment "Dialogue caption, spoken by the night_shift NPC (voiced; tools/assets/dialogue/night_shift). Changing it needs: tools\\cli asset dialogue night_shift"
    }
    CustomStringTableItem "{DE5B4981A3551962}" {
     Id "LF-Dialogue_NightShift_GreetRefuses"
     Target_en_us "I know your face from the night. Do not speak to me."
     Comment "Dialogue caption, spoken by the night_shift NPC (voiced; tools/assets/dialogue/night_shift). Changing it needs: tools\\cli asset dialogue night_shift"
    }
    CustomStringTableItem "{A3A002843565D613}" {
     Id "LF-Dialogue_NightShift_GreetRegular"
     Target_en_us "My friend! The night is long and your company shortens it. What do you want to know?"
     Comment "Dialogue caption, spoken by the night_shift NPC (voiced; tools/assets/dialogue/night_shift). Changing it needs: tools\\cli asset dialogue night_shift"
    }
    CustomStringTableItem "{313BEDDBB4D62D31}" {
     Id "LF-Dialogue_NightShift_GreetWary"
     Target_en_us "You again. Make it short, I have work."
     Comment "Dialogue caption, spoken by the night_shift NPC (voiced; tools/assets/dialogue/night_shift). Changing it needs: tools\\cli asset dialogue night_shift"
    }
    CustomStringTableItem "{D435BA49E015D84F}" {
     Id "LF-Dialogue_NightShift_SayBye"
     Target_en_us "Goodbye."
     Comment "Dialogue reply the player can pick when talking to the night_shift NPC."
    }
    CustomStringTableItem "{88229E39461B49AD}" {
     Id "LF-Dialogue_NightShift_SayMove"
     Target_en_us "How was the move?"
     Comment "Dialogue reply the player can pick when talking to the night_shift NPC."
    }
    CustomStringTableItem "{934605F1DC35249E}" {
     Id "LF-Dialogue_NightShift_SayTip"
     Target_en_us "Heard anyone's buying, quiet like?"
     Comment "Night-shift worker reply (#2922): asks the informant where the buyer stands today; shown only to someone he would tell."
    }
    CustomStringTableItem "{BCCC43C3AC789D1A}" {
     Id "LF-Dialogue_NightShift_SayWork"
     Target_en_us "Is there work for me?"
     Comment "Dialogue reply the player can pick when talking to the night_shift NPC."
    }
    CustomStringTableItem "{DE78ADF43EDC7C40}" {
     Id "LF-Dialogue_NightShift_SayZone"
     Target_en_us "You worked near the Zone?"
     Comment "Dialogue reply the player can pick when talking to the night_shift NPC."
    }
    CustomStringTableItem "{E5E24AE2CCC8C2D2}" {
     Id "LF-Dialogue_OldMan_AnniversaryLetterSecret"
     Target_en_us "Dominique counted the drums before they emptied the Zone. He wrote the markings down for the mayor. I saw the same marks on the night boats, and I said nothing. Keep this to yourself until you know who is listening."
     Comment "Dialogue caption, spoken by the old_man NPC (voiced; tools/assets/dialogue/old_man). Changing it needs: tools\\cli asset dialogue old_man"
    }
    CustomStringTableItem "{B3AF520461B54CC4}" {
     Id "LF-Dialogue_OldMan_AnniversaryLetterThanks"
     Target_en_us "Dominique. Three years, and it comes to me out of a heap of flowers. Thank you for carrying it."
     Comment "Dialogue caption, spoken by the old_man NPC (voiced; tools/assets/dialogue/old_man). Changing it needs: tools\\cli asset dialogue old_man"
    }
    CustomStringTableItem "{AA83C29649EB0D96}" {
     Id "LF-Dialogue_OldMan_Bye"
     Target_en_us "Go well. Come and sit with me again some time."
     Comment "Dialogue caption, spoken by the old_man NPC (voiced; tools/assets/dialogue/old_man). Changing it needs: tools\\cli asset dialogue old_man"
    }
    CustomStringTableItem "{14C00C49DD440471}" {
     Id "LF-Dialogue_OldMan_Cove"
     Target_en_us "You have the hands for it now. There is a cove below the lighthouse, Fisherman Bay. Go at dusk, when the bass come in close. I have marked it on your map."
     Comment "Gaspard tells a player who has landed three fish about the cove Fisherman Bay (#3451); text only, no recording yet."
    }
    CustomStringTableItem "{EE06F137A9E223A3}" {
     Id "LF-Dialogue_OldMan_Greet"
     Target_en_us "Sit down a minute. Everyone is in a hurry these days. I only watch the square."
     Comment "Dialogue caption, spoken by the old_man NPC (voiced; tools/assets/dialogue/old_man). Changing it needs: tools\\cli asset dialogue old_man"
    }
    CustomStringTableItem "{19F518135D4FF803}" {
     Id "LF-Dialogue_OldMan_GreetFriendly"
     Target_en_us "Ah, there you are. A friendly face is good to see. Sit a moment."
     Comment "Dialogue caption, spoken by the old_man NPC (voiced; tools/assets/dialogue/old_man). Changing it needs: tools\\cli asset dialogue old_man"
    }
    CustomStringTableItem "{3582FBD5E8DCF917}" {
     Id "LF-Dialogue_OldMan_GreetRefuses"
     Target_en_us "I saw what you did. Keep walking."
     Comment "Dialogue caption, spoken by the old_man NPC (voiced; tools/assets/dialogue/old_man). Changing it needs: tools\\cli asset dialogue old_man"
    }
    CustomStringTableItem "{02D74A9E8D29DB53}" {
     Id "LF-Dialogue_OldMan_GreetRegular"
     Target_en_us "My friend! The harbor is better for having you in it. What can an old fisherman do for you?"
     Comment "Dialogue caption, spoken by the old_man NPC (voiced; tools/assets/dialogue/old_man). Changing it needs: tools\\cli asset dialogue old_man"
    }
    CustomStringTableItem "{0DA987094106C72C}" {
     Id "LF-Dialogue_OldMan_GreetWary"
     Target_en_us "Hm. You again. Say what you want, and be quick."
     Comment "Dialogue caption, spoken by the old_man NPC (voiced; tools/assets/dialogue/old_man). Changing it needs: tools\\cli asset dialogue old_man"
    }
    CustomStringTableItem "{22873025BE77ACB7}" {
     Id "LF-Dialogue_OldMan_Move"
     Target_en_us "The first winter was hard. But the island people brought us wood and soup, and nobody asked what we had left behind. That is how you start again."
     Comment "Dialogue caption, spoken by the old_man NPC (voiced; tools/assets/dialogue/old_man). Changing it needs: tools\\cli asset dialogue old_man"
    }
    CustomStringTableItem "{EC42A63E9256573A}" {
     Id "LF-Dialogue_OldMan_SayBye"
     Target_en_us "Goodbye."
     Comment "Dialogue reply the player can pick when talking to the old_man NPC."
    }
    CustomStringTableItem "{3747C32C2EB98228}" {
     Id "LF-Dialogue_OldMan_SayCove"
     Target_en_us "Know a good place to fish?"
     Comment "Dialogue reply to Gaspard (the old man), offered once the player has landed three fish (#3451)."
    }
    CustomStringTableItem "{832F4B08E545D1A4}" {
     Id "LF-Dialogue_OldMan_SayHandIn"
     Target_en_us "I found a letter in the church flowers. It is addressed to you."
     Comment "Dialogue reply the player can pick when talking to the old_man NPC."
    }
    CustomStringTableItem "{98D9AB69AB1E7F3A}" {
     Id "LF-Dialogue_OldMan_SayMove"
     Target_en_us "What was the move like?"
     Comment "Dialogue reply the player can pick when talking to the old_man NPC."
    }
    CustomStringTableItem "{C5A97F774527E844}" {
     Id "LF-Dialogue_OldMan_SaySecret"
     Target_en_us "What did Dominique know?"
     Comment "Dialogue reply the player can pick when talking to the old_man NPC."
    }
    CustomStringTableItem "{2FA08445AB21D4F7}" {
     Id "LF-Dialogue_OldMan_SayStart"
     Target_en_us "Where should I start here?"
     Comment "Dialogue reply the player can pick when talking to the old_man NPC."
    }
    CustomStringTableItem "{6D010E5A1CFA729E}" {
     Id "LF-Dialogue_OldMan_SayZone"
     Target_en_us "Do you remember the zone?"
     Comment "Dialogue reply the player can pick when talking to the old_man NPC."
    }
    CustomStringTableItem "{8670E0234E8438C0}" {
     Id "LF-Dialogue_OldMan_Start"
     Target_en_us "Read the town board on the square. It shows where everything is. Then see the clerk, right beside it. He was kind to us, and he will be kind to you."
     Comment "Dialogue caption, spoken by the old_man NPC (voiced; tools/assets/dialogue/old_man). Changing it needs: tools\\cli asset dialogue old_man"
    }
    CustomStringTableItem "{B7F1FD0AA8489C85}" {
     Id "LF-Dialogue_OldMan_Zone"
     Target_en_us "I lived near the zone. We were given one morning to pack. One suitcase each. I took my wife's coat and a jar of her cherry jam. The jam is gone. The coat I keep."
     Comment "Dialogue caption, spoken by the old_man NPC (voiced; tools/assets/dialogue/old_man). Changing it needs: tools\\cli asset dialogue old_man"
    }
    CustomStringTableItem "{BC1BAB3B06E2E1D5}" {
     Id "LF-Dialogue_Passerby_AboutWhat"
     Target_en_us "Nothing much, and that is the point. A drink, the band if they turn up, somebody's uncle telling the same story about the war."
     Comment "Dialogue caption, spoken by the passerby NPC (text only; tools/assets/dialogue/passerby). Changing it needs: tools\\cli asset dialogue passerby"
    }
    CustomStringTableItem "{6CAD837815E806A0}" {
     Id "LF-Dialogue_Passerby_AboutWhere"
     Target_en_us "The cafe is on the square, the bank across from it. For anything official, the town hall clerk. For anything unofficial, nobody saw me say a word."
     Comment "Dialogue caption, spoken by the passerby NPC (text only; tools/assets/dialogue/passerby). Changing it needs: tools\\cli asset dialogue passerby"
    }
    CustomStringTableItem "{8925AD9FFCA979D0}" {
     Id "LF-Dialogue_Passerby_Bye"
     Target_en_us "Enjoy the evening."
     Comment "Dialogue caption, spoken by the passerby NPC (text only; tools/assets/dialogue/passerby). Changing it needs: tools\\cli asset dialogue passerby"
    }
    CustomStringTableItem "{73729ADBBDD98B05}" {
     Id "LF-Dialogue_Passerby_Greet"
     Target_en_us "Evening. Lovely night for it, isn't it? Half the town is out on the square."
     Comment "Dialogue caption, spoken by the passerby NPC (text only; tools/assets/dialogue/passerby). Changing it needs: tools\\cli asset dialogue passerby"
    }
    CustomStringTableItem "{79C148CCB0DADFAD}" {
     Id "LF-Dialogue_Passerby_Name"
     Target_en_us "Townsperson"
     Comment "Speaker name above the dialogue caption: a townsperson out on the square during an evening or anniversary scene."
    }
    CustomStringTableItem "{03E4899CF1C5E0A0}" {
     Id "LF-Dialogue_Passerby_SayBye"
     Target_en_us "Goodbye."
     Comment "Dialogue reply the player can pick when talking to the passerby NPC."
    }
    CustomStringTableItem "{B40024D0FFD27C3C}" {
     Id "LF-Dialogue_Passerby_SayWhat"
     Target_en_us "What is going on tonight?"
     Comment "Dialogue reply the player can pick when talking to the passerby NPC."
    }
    CustomStringTableItem "{9EB3A27E46F9D774}" {
     Id "LF-Dialogue_Passerby_SayWhere"
     Target_en_us "Where can I find things around here?"
     Comment "Dialogue reply the player can pick when talking to the passerby NPC."
    }
    CustomStringTableItem "{D706E5724264476D}" {
     Id "LF-Dialogue_RelocatedWalker_AboutFrom"
     Target_en_us "From near the Zone. They gave us one suitcase each and a paper with an address on it. That is all of it, here."
     Comment "Dialogue caption, spoken by the relocated_walker NPC (text only; tools/assets/dialogue/relocated_walker). Changing it needs: tools\\cli asset dialogue relocated_walker"
    }
    CustomStringTableItem "{95C23064D57F8EF3}" {
     Id "LF-Dialogue_RelocatedWalker_AboutHelp"
     Target_en_us "Just point us at the town hall, if you would. The clerk is meant to have our names and a key."
     Comment "Dialogue caption, spoken by the relocated_walker NPC (text only; tools/assets/dialogue/relocated_walker). Changing it needs: tools\\cli asset dialogue relocated_walker"
    }
    CustomStringTableItem "{B611154030D5A065}" {
     Id "LF-Dialogue_RelocatedWalker_Bye"
     Target_en_us "Thank you. Thank you, really."
     Comment "Dialogue caption, spoken by the relocated_walker NPC (text only; tools/assets/dialogue/relocated_walker). Changing it needs: tools\\cli asset dialogue relocated_walker"
    }
    CustomStringTableItem "{0316F4A142D30329}" {
     Id "LF-Dialogue_RelocatedWalker_Greet"
     Target_en_us "Sorry, we have only just come off the bus. Is this Saint-Philippe? They said someone would meet us."
     Comment "Dialogue caption, spoken by the relocated_walker NPC (text only; tools/assets/dialogue/relocated_walker). Changing it needs: tools\\cli asset dialogue relocated_walker"
    }
    CustomStringTableItem "{C26AD1BAC4237BDC}" {
     Id "LF-Dialogue_RelocatedWalker_Name"
     Target_en_us "New arrival"
     Comment "Speaker name above the dialogue caption: a family member just off the relocation bus."
    }
    CustomStringTableItem "{57F56F43353F146D}" {
     Id "LF-Dialogue_RelocatedWalker_SayBye"
     Target_en_us "Welcome to town."
     Comment "Dialogue reply the player can pick when talking to the relocated_walker NPC."
    }
    CustomStringTableItem "{98C1B7E8787D268B}" {
     Id "LF-Dialogue_RelocatedWalker_SayFrom"
     Target_en_us "Where have you come from?"
     Comment "Dialogue reply the player can pick when talking to the relocated_walker NPC."
    }
    CustomStringTableItem "{317166EC520F5200}" {
     Id "LF-Dialogue_RelocatedWalker_SayHelp"
     Target_en_us "Can I help with anything?"
     Comment "Dialogue reply the player can pick when talking to the relocated_walker NPC."
    }
    CustomStringTableItem "{CD365C03E5B40FA0}" {
     Id "LF-Dialogue_ResidentAnselme_AboutFamily"
     Target_en_us "Marius is my brother. He spends his mornings at the cafe and knows everything before the newspaper does."
     Comment "Dialogue caption, spoken by the resident_anselme NPC (text only; tools/assets/dialogue/resident_anselme). Changing it needs: tools\\cli asset dialogue resident_anselme"
    }
    CustomStringTableItem "{04C501AFD83A49C8}" {
     Id "LF-Dialogue_ResidentAnselme_AboutTown"
     Target_en_us "We came over from the mainland long before all this. Now half the street are new faces from the Zone. Good people. Tired people."
     Comment "Dialogue caption, spoken by the resident_anselme NPC (text only; tools/assets/dialogue/resident_anselme). Changing it needs: tools\\cli asset dialogue resident_anselme"
    }
    CustomStringTableItem "{8E4218733758EA08}" {
     Id "LF-Dialogue_ResidentAnselme_AboutVan"
     Target_en_us "The van run? Take the yellow van from the post stand, load four mail sacks, drive them to the post office in Meaux and bring my van back. Back in one piece, mind. A wrecked van pays nobody."
     Comment "Dialogue caption, spoken by the resident_anselme NPC (voiced; tools/assets/dialogue/resident_anselme). Changing it needs: tools\\cli asset dialogue resident_anselme"
    }
    CustomStringTableItem "{A5BA275D87A49B27}" {
     Id "LF-Dialogue_ResidentAnselme_AboutWork"
     Target_en_us "Letters, parcels, the odd crate of machine parts for the farms. If you want work, the depot pays by the drop. Ask at the counter."
     Comment "Dialogue caption, spoken by the resident_anselme NPC (text only; tools/assets/dialogue/resident_anselme). Changing it needs: tools\\cli asset dialogue resident_anselme"
    }
    CustomStringTableItem "{A4A16334CC080119}" {
     Id "LF-Dialogue_ResidentAnselme_Bye"
     Target_en_us "Take care now."
     Comment "Dialogue caption, spoken by the resident_anselme NPC (text only; tools/assets/dialogue/resident_anselme). Changing it needs: tools\\cli asset dialogue resident_anselme"
    }
    CustomStringTableItem "{A38CD21D1F928316}" {
     Id "LF-Dialogue_ResidentAnselme_Greet"
     Target_en_us "Anselme Caron. I sort the parcels at the depot, so if your post is late, blame the ferry, not me."
     Comment "Dialogue caption, spoken by the resident_anselme NPC (text only; tools/assets/dialogue/resident_anselme). Changing it needs: tools\\cli asset dialogue resident_anselme"
    }
    CustomStringTableItem "{86B0D34320EBCD31}" {
     Id "LF-Dialogue_ResidentAnselme_GreetFriendly"
     Target_en_us "Hello, hello. No parcel for you today, I am afraid."
     Comment "Dialogue caption, spoken by the resident_anselme NPC (text only; tools/assets/dialogue/resident_anselme). Changing it needs: tools\\cli asset dialogue resident_anselme"
    }
    CustomStringTableItem "{43D7938263666FDD}" {
     Id "LF-Dialogue_ResidentAnselme_GreetRefuses"
     Target_en_us "No. I have heard what you did. Leave me be."
     Comment "Dialogue caption, spoken by the resident_anselme NPC (text only; tools/assets/dialogue/resident_anselme). Changing it needs: tools\\cli asset dialogue resident_anselme"
    }
    CustomStringTableItem "{F5F45D4080B74718}" {
     Id "LF-Dialogue_ResidentAnselme_GreetRegular"
     Target_en_us "Ah, my friend! Marius made too much soup again. Come by tonight."
     Comment "Dialogue caption, spoken by the resident_anselme NPC (text only; tools/assets/dialogue/resident_anselme). Changing it needs: tools\\cli asset dialogue resident_anselme"
    }
    CustomStringTableItem "{9FADC716B9FC0BBA}" {
     Id "LF-Dialogue_ResidentAnselme_GreetWary"
     Target_en_us "You. Keep your distance, please."
     Comment "Dialogue caption, spoken by the resident_anselme NPC (text only; tools/assets/dialogue/resident_anselme). Changing it needs: tools\\cli asset dialogue resident_anselme"
    }
    CustomStringTableItem "{F880A69372803162}" {
     Id "LF-Dialogue_ResidentAnselme_SayBye"
     Target_en_us "Goodbye."
     Comment "Dialogue reply the player can pick when talking to the resident_anselme NPC."
    }
    CustomStringTableItem "{9C7587601E0525A8}" {
     Id "LF-Dialogue_ResidentAnselme_SayFamily"
     Target_en_us "Who is Marius?"
     Comment "Dialogue reply the player can pick when talking to the resident_anselme NPC."
    }
    CustomStringTableItem "{56A57C39752E93D7}" {
     Id "LF-Dialogue_ResidentAnselme_SayTown"
     Target_en_us "Have you lived here long?"
     Comment "Dialogue reply the player can pick when talking to the resident_anselme NPC."
    }
    CustomStringTableItem "{2B4A32963B1B0AD7}" {
     Id "LF-Dialogue_ResidentAnselme_SayVan"
     Target_en_us "Tell me about the van run."
     Comment "Dialogue reply the player can pick when talking to the resident_anselme NPC."
    }
    CustomStringTableItem "{89C193968FE10340}" {
     Id "LF-Dialogue_ResidentAnselme_SayWork"
     Target_en_us "What do you do at the depot?"
     Comment "Dialogue reply the player can pick when talking to the resident_anselme NPC."
    }
    CustomStringTableItem "{AA8C36A200C82511}" {
     Id "LF-Dialogue_ResidentMireille_AboutAnniversary"
     Target_en_us "The town anniversary is coming. The mayor has the whole square scrubbed. Bastien does love a speech."
     Comment "Dialogue caption, spoken by the resident_mireille NPC (text only; tools/assets/dialogue/resident_mireille). Changing it needs: tools\\cli asset dialogue resident_mireille"
    }
    CustomStringTableItem "{C9F228A9AA9EAB3C}" {
     Id "LF-Dialogue_ResidentMireille_AboutCafe"
     Target_en_us "Odilon runs the cafe. He keeps the best table for the mayor and pretends he does not."
     Comment "Dialogue caption, spoken by the resident_mireille NPC (text only; tools/assets/dialogue/resident_mireille). Changing it needs: tools\\cli asset dialogue resident_mireille"
    }
    CustomStringTableItem "{54FD7200DA7DFF55}" {
     Id "LF-Dialogue_ResidentMireille_AboutGossip"
     Target_en_us "They say the harbor master counts his crates twice since the spring. And somebody has been buying a great deal of sugar. Make of it what you like."
     Comment "Dialogue caption, spoken by the resident_mireille NPC (text only; tools/assets/dialogue/resident_mireille). Changing it needs: tools\\cli asset dialogue resident_mireille"
    }
    CustomStringTableItem "{D804C106D3DFEC19}" {
     Id "LF-Dialogue_ResidentMireille_Bye"
     Target_en_us "See you soon, dear."
     Comment "Dialogue caption, spoken by the resident_mireille NPC (text only; tools/assets/dialogue/resident_mireille). Changing it needs: tools\\cli asset dialogue resident_mireille"
    }
    CustomStringTableItem "{ECD55BE8D4B9C801}" {
     Id "LF-Dialogue_ResidentMireille_Greet"
     Target_en_us "Good morning. Marius. Forgive me, I only came out for a coffee and a little conversation."
     Comment "Dialogue caption, spoken by the resident_mireille NPC (text only; tools/assets/dialogue/resident_mireille). Changing it needs: tools\\cli asset dialogue resident_mireille"
    }
    CustomStringTableItem "{D608E1EFD91B9415}" {
     Id "LF-Dialogue_ResidentMireille_GreetFriendly"
     Target_en_us "Hello, dear. Sit. The coffee here is terrible, but it is hot."
     Comment "Dialogue caption, spoken by the resident_mireille NPC (text only; tools/assets/dialogue/resident_mireille). Changing it needs: tools\\cli asset dialogue resident_mireille"
    }
    CustomStringTableItem "{D91EFB7C83A367BD}" {
     Id "LF-Dialogue_ResidentMireille_GreetRefuses"
     Target_en_us "I know what you are. I do not speak to people like you."
     Comment "Dialogue caption, spoken by the resident_mireille NPC (text only; tools/assets/dialogue/resident_mireille). Changing it needs: tools\\cli asset dialogue resident_mireille"
    }
    CustomStringTableItem "{1E1D746AB72C4E67}" {
     Id "LF-Dialogue_ResidentMireille_GreetRegular"
     Target_en_us "There you are! I was just telling Odilon about you."
     Comment "Dialogue caption, spoken by the resident_mireille NPC (text only; tools/assets/dialogue/resident_mireille). Changing it needs: tools\\cli asset dialogue resident_mireille"
    }
    CustomStringTableItem "{C7DD49231882FF53}" {
     Id "LF-Dialogue_ResidentMireille_GreetWary"
     Target_en_us "Oh. Hello. I would rather not chat today."
     Comment "Dialogue caption, spoken by the resident_mireille NPC (text only; tools/assets/dialogue/resident_mireille). Changing it needs: tools\\cli asset dialogue resident_mireille"
    }
    CustomStringTableItem "{D8186454058B6919}" {
     Id "LF-Dialogue_ResidentMireille_SayAnniversary"
     Target_en_us "What is happening on the square?"
     Comment "Dialogue reply the player can pick when talking to the resident_mireille NPC."
    }
    CustomStringTableItem "{8576FA43FF44D73F}" {
     Id "LF-Dialogue_ResidentMireille_SayBye"
     Target_en_us "Goodbye."
     Comment "Dialogue reply the player can pick when talking to the resident_mireille NPC."
    }
    CustomStringTableItem "{8A75A4051AC3E201}" {
     Id "LF-Dialogue_ResidentMireille_SayCafe"
     Target_en_us "Tell me about the cafe."
     Comment "Dialogue reply the player can pick when talking to the resident_mireille NPC."
    }
    CustomStringTableItem "{4983C75825B7DC8D}" {
     Id "LF-Dialogue_ResidentMireille_SayGossip"
     Target_en_us "Heard any gossip?"
     Comment "Dialogue reply the player can pick when talking to the resident_mireille NPC."
    }
    CustomStringTableItem "{8552D2F221FAA3D0}" {
     Id "LF-Dialogue_ResidentStoreClerk_AboutFerry"
     Target_en_us "Everything comes by the ferry. When the weather turns the shelves go bare, and everybody blames me."
     Comment "Dialogue caption, spoken by the resident_store_clerk NPC (text only; tools/assets/dialogue/resident_store_clerk). Changing it needs: tools\\cli asset dialogue resident_store_clerk"
    }
    CustomStringTableItem "{1B72F02DA19BE523}" {
     Id "LF-Dialogue_ResidentStoreClerk_AboutTown"
     Target_en_us "Quiet, mostly. Since the new families came there is more bread to bake and more faces to learn."
     Comment "Dialogue caption, spoken by the resident_store_clerk NPC (text only; tools/assets/dialogue/resident_store_clerk). Changing it needs: tools\\cli asset dialogue resident_store_clerk"
    }
    CustomStringTableItem "{17E4C7B8C8E760FF}" {
     Id "LF-Dialogue_ResidentStoreClerk_AboutWork"
     Target_en_us "Tins, rope, batteries, cigarettes. Half the island comes through my door before noon. Pay at the till and do not lean on the glass."
     Comment "Dialogue caption, spoken by the resident_store_clerk NPC (text only; tools/assets/dialogue/resident_store_clerk). Changing it needs: tools\\cli asset dialogue resident_store_clerk"
    }
    CustomStringTableItem "{B713054422C71238}" {
     Id "LF-Dialogue_ResidentStoreClerk_Bye"
     Target_en_us "Mind how you go."
     Comment "Dialogue caption, spoken by the resident_store_clerk NPC (text only; tools/assets/dialogue/resident_store_clerk). Changing it needs: tools\\cli asset dialogue resident_store_clerk"
    }
    CustomStringTableItem "{F55E5E74B09A1BB9}" {
     Id "LF-Dialogue_ResidentStoreClerk_Greet"
     Target_en_us "Pierre Vasseur, general store. If we do not have it, the ferry might bring it on Thursday."
     Comment "Dialogue caption, spoken by the resident_store_clerk NPC (text only; tools/assets/dialogue/resident_store_clerk). Changing it needs: tools\\cli asset dialogue resident_store_clerk"
    }
    CustomStringTableItem "{8E3DA3857FDC829F}" {
     Id "LF-Dialogue_ResidentStoreClerk_GreetFriendly"
     Target_en_us "Good to see you. The bread came in fresh this morning."
     Comment "Dialogue caption, spoken by the resident_store_clerk NPC (text only; tools/assets/dialogue/resident_store_clerk). Changing it needs: tools\\cli asset dialogue resident_store_clerk"
    }
    CustomStringTableItem "{080592BB654DEAE6}" {
     Id "LF-Dialogue_ResidentStoreClerk_GreetRefuses"
     Target_en_us "You are not welcome at my counter. Go on."
     Comment "Dialogue caption, spoken by the resident_store_clerk NPC (text only; tools/assets/dialogue/resident_store_clerk). Changing it needs: tools\\cli asset dialogue resident_store_clerk"
    }
    CustomStringTableItem "{86DEB827F5774B5E}" {
     Id "LF-Dialogue_ResidentStoreClerk_GreetRegular"
     Target_en_us "My best customer! I put a tin of the good coffee aside for you."
     Comment "Dialogue caption, spoken by the resident_store_clerk NPC (text only; tools/assets/dialogue/resident_store_clerk). Changing it needs: tools\\cli asset dialogue resident_store_clerk"
    }
    CustomStringTableItem "{B1ED0C5D5934330F}" {
     Id "LF-Dialogue_ResidentStoreClerk_GreetWary"
     Target_en_us "I have my eye on you. Pay for what you take."
     Comment "Dialogue caption, spoken by the resident_store_clerk NPC (text only; tools/assets/dialogue/resident_store_clerk). Changing it needs: tools\\cli asset dialogue resident_store_clerk"
    }
    CustomStringTableItem "{64C9BFBCF919ABD4}" {
     Id "LF-Dialogue_ResidentStoreClerk_SayBye"
     Target_en_us "Goodbye."
     Comment "Dialogue reply the player can pick when talking to the resident_store_clerk NPC."
    }
    CustomStringTableItem "{7AD51DB89AE01558}" {
     Id "LF-Dialogue_ResidentStoreClerk_SayFerry"
     Target_en_us "Where does your stock come from?"
     Comment "Dialogue reply the player can pick when talking to the resident_store_clerk NPC."
    }
    CustomStringTableItem "{B85C72A57B228AF5}" {
     Id "LF-Dialogue_ResidentStoreClerk_SayTown"
     Target_en_us "How is the town these days?"
     Comment "Dialogue reply the player can pick when talking to the resident_store_clerk NPC."
    }
    CustomStringTableItem "{74EC021358C25DE9}" {
     Id "LF-Dialogue_ResidentStoreClerk_SayWork"
     Target_en_us "What does the store sell?"
     Comment "Dialogue reply the player can pick when talking to the resident_store_clerk NPC."
    }
    CustomStringTableItem "{491C02ED121C93FA}" {
     Id "LF-Dialogue_ResidentTeller_AboutAdvice"
     Target_en_us "Bank your pay the day you get it. What sits in your pocket can walk off. What sits with us stays yours."
     Comment "Dialogue caption, spoken by the resident_teller NPC (text only; tools/assets/dialogue/resident_teller). Changing it needs: tools\\cli asset dialogue resident_teller"
    }
    CustomStringTableItem "{CFBCAA93DD23E07D}" {
     Id "LF-Dialogue_ResidentTeller_AboutTown"
     Target_en_us "Saint-Philippe gossips faster than the telephone. If you want to know a thing, sit at the cafe and wait."
     Comment "Dialogue caption, spoken by the resident_teller NPC (text only; tools/assets/dialogue/resident_teller). Changing it needs: tools\\cli asset dialogue resident_teller"
    }
    CustomStringTableItem "{7ABFA0FA91264BC4}" {
     Id "LF-Dialogue_ResidentTeller_AboutWork"
     Target_en_us "I keep the counter at the First Bank of Everon. Deposits, withdrawals, and listening to the farmers argue about the price of feed."
     Comment "Dialogue caption, spoken by the resident_teller NPC (text only; tools/assets/dialogue/resident_teller). Changing it needs: tools\\cli asset dialogue resident_teller"
    }
    CustomStringTableItem "{48A118DC6002BAED}" {
     Id "LF-Dialogue_ResidentTeller_Bye"
     Target_en_us "Good day to you."
     Comment "Dialogue caption, spoken by the resident_teller NPC (text only; tools/assets/dialogue/resident_teller). Changing it needs: tools\\cli asset dialogue resident_teller"
    }
    CustomStringTableItem "{574C7DDD6C967AF5}" {
     Id "LF-Dialogue_ResidentTeller_Greet"
     Target_en_us "Good day. I am off the counter just now, but I don't bite. Lucien, from the bank."
     Comment "Dialogue caption, spoken by the resident_teller NPC (text only; tools/assets/dialogue/resident_teller). Changing it needs: tools\\cli asset dialogue resident_teller"
    }
    CustomStringTableItem "{61EEE4365FEB146C}" {
     Id "LF-Dialogue_ResidentTeller_GreetFriendly"
     Target_en_us "Ah, hello again. Your account is in better shape than most, you know."
     Comment "Dialogue caption, spoken by the resident_teller NPC (text only; tools/assets/dialogue/resident_teller). Changing it needs: tools\\cli asset dialogue resident_teller"
    }
    CustomStringTableItem "{CCF9738AF8A9EC1D}" {
     Id "LF-Dialogue_ResidentTeller_GreetRefuses"
     Target_en_us "I count other people's money all day. I will not waste my words on you."
     Comment "Dialogue caption, spoken by the resident_teller NPC (text only; tools/assets/dialogue/resident_teller). Changing it needs: tools\\cli asset dialogue resident_teller"
    }
    CustomStringTableItem "{C6E819E143305811}" {
     Id "LF-Dialogue_ResidentTeller_GreetRegular"
     Target_en_us "There you are! Sit down a minute. The bank can wait."
     Comment "Dialogue caption, spoken by the resident_teller NPC (text only; tools/assets/dialogue/resident_teller). Changing it needs: tools\\cli asset dialogue resident_teller"
    }
    CustomStringTableItem "{589632E8B515A198}" {
     Id "LF-Dialogue_ResidentTeller_GreetWary"
     Target_en_us "Mm. I remember you. Mind your manners and we will get along."
     Comment "Dialogue caption, spoken by the resident_teller NPC (text only; tools/assets/dialogue/resident_teller). Changing it needs: tools\\cli asset dialogue resident_teller"
    }
    CustomStringTableItem "{5D46CBA6E324523D}" {
     Id "LF-Dialogue_ResidentTeller_SayAdvice"
     Target_en_us "Any advice about money?"
     Comment "Dialogue reply the player can pick when talking to the resident_teller NPC."
    }
    CustomStringTableItem "{EEDCEA14BDC8BFF5}" {
     Id "LF-Dialogue_ResidentTeller_SayBye"
     Target_en_us "Goodbye."
     Comment "Dialogue reply the player can pick when talking to the resident_teller NPC."
    }
    CustomStringTableItem "{66C07B73B876D808}" {
     Id "LF-Dialogue_ResidentTeller_SayTown"
     Target_en_us "What is the town like?"
     Comment "Dialogue reply the player can pick when talking to the resident_teller NPC."
    }
    CustomStringTableItem "{986E7E5916906E46}" {
     Id "LF-Dialogue_ResidentTeller_SayWork"
     Target_en_us "What do you do at the bank?"
     Comment "Dialogue reply the player can pick when talking to the resident_teller NPC."
    }
    CustomStringTableItem "{D29F985D42EAC058}" {
     Id "LF-Dialogue_RoleFenceEveron_Bye"
     Target_en_us "We never spoke."
     Comment "Pack patch of the role_fence dialogue's line bye (voiced; tools/assets/dialogue/role_fence_everon). Changing it needs: tools\\cli asset dialogue role_fence_everon"
    }
    CustomStringTableItem "{96BCAA1CD274CA52}" {
     Id "LF-Dialogue_RoleFenceEveron_Greet"
     Target_en_us "You did not see me. Now, what are you after?"
     Comment "Pack patch of the role_fence dialogue's line greet (voiced; tools/assets/dialogue/role_fence_everon). Changing it needs: tools\\cli asset dialogue role_fence_everon"
    }
    CustomStringTableItem "{BF2804A075D06D89}" {
     Id "LF-Dialogue_RoleFenceEveron_Rumour"
     Target_en_us "Somebody sold a drill and a charge to the wrong customer. The wrong customer was the police."
     Comment "Pack patch of the role_fence dialogue's line rumour (voiced; tools/assets/dialogue/role_fence_everon). Changing it needs: tools\\cli asset dialogue role_fence_everon"
    }
    CustomStringTableItem "{4FDB1AC1ACEA8C7C}" {
     Id "LF-Dialogue_RoleFenceEveron_What"
     Target_en_us "I sell tools to people who do not ask what they are for. Locks are hard and the police are harder. Choose the right tool."
     Comment "Pack patch of the role_fence dialogue's line what (voiced; tools/assets/dialogue/role_fence_everon). Changing it needs: tools\\cli asset dialogue role_fence_everon"
    }
    CustomStringTableItem "{F780F1A89DA24D9E}" {
     Id "LF-Dialogue_RoleFenceEveron_Where"
     Target_en_us "Ask nobody about me. Keep to the back streets."
     Comment "Pack patch of the role_fence dialogue's line where (voiced; tools/assets/dialogue/role_fence_everon). Changing it needs: tools\\cli asset dialogue role_fence_everon"
    }
    CustomStringTableItem "{0988F7F8C0BF3C64}" {
     Id "LF-Dialogue_RoleMechanicEveron_Bye"
     Target_en_us "Drive safe."
     Comment "Pack patch of the role_mechanic dialogue's line bye (voiced; tools/assets/dialogue/role_mechanic_everon). Changing it needs: tools\\cli asset dialogue role_mechanic_everon"
    }
    CustomStringTableItem "{2AFA2E399F21B7AD}" {
     Id "LF-Dialogue_RoleMechanicEveron_Greet"
     Target_en_us "Mind the oil. What is wrong with it?"
     Comment "Pack patch of the role_mechanic dialogue's line greet (voiced; tools/assets/dialogue/role_mechanic_everon). Changing it needs: tools\\cli asset dialogue role_mechanic_everon"
    }
    CustomStringTableItem "{58698B79CA4AA7AE}" {
     Id "LF-Dialogue_RoleMechanicEveron_Rumour"
     Target_en_us "Somebody keeps asking me how to start a car without the key. I tell them to buy the key."
     Comment "Pack patch of the role_mechanic dialogue's line rumour (voiced; tools/assets/dialogue/role_mechanic_everon). Changing it needs: tools\\cli asset dialogue role_mechanic_everon"
    }
    CustomStringTableItem "{1F9C08528FCD2960}" {
     Id "LF-Dialogue_RoleMechanicEveron_What"
     Target_en_us "I fix cars. A new battery, a repair kit, the right fuel, and it runs. Most breakdowns are a flat battery."
     Comment "Pack patch of the role_mechanic dialogue's line what (voiced; tools/assets/dialogue/role_mechanic_everon). Changing it needs: tools\\cli asset dialogue role_mechanic_everon"
    }
    CustomStringTableItem "{67D6EE4A23585976}" {
     Id "LF-Dialogue_RoleMechanicEveron_Where"
     Target_en_us "The car lot is on the east side, and the fuel station is down the road. Fill up before you go far."
     Comment "Pack patch of the role_mechanic dialogue's line where (voiced; tools/assets/dialogue/role_mechanic_everon). Changing it needs: tools\\cli asset dialogue role_mechanic_everon"
    }
    CustomStringTableItem "{B97EE41392E9B150}" {
     Id "LF-Dialogue_RoleMedicEveron_Bye"
     Target_en_us "Look after yourself."
     Comment "Pack patch of the role_medic dialogue's line bye (voiced; tools/assets/dialogue/role_medic_everon). Changing it needs: tools\\cli asset dialogue role_medic_everon"
    }
    CustomStringTableItem "{345068A447236EBF}" {
     Id "LF-Dialogue_RoleMedicEveron_Greet"
     Target_en_us "Come in. Are you hurt?"
     Comment "Pack patch of the role_medic dialogue's line greet (voiced; tools/assets/dialogue/role_medic_everon). Changing it needs: tools\\cli asset dialogue role_medic_everon"
    }
    CustomStringTableItem "{00BB754B066A04A1}" {
     Id "LF-Dialogue_RoleMedicEveron_Rumour"
     Target_en_us "A lot of cuts from the sawmill this month. The men will not wear gloves."
     Comment "Pack patch of the role_medic dialogue's line rumour (voiced; tools/assets/dialogue/role_medic_everon). Changing it needs: tools\\cli asset dialogue role_medic_everon"
    }
    CustomStringTableItem "{35F722E64421CE24}" {
     Id "LF-Dialogue_RoleMedicEveron_What"
     Target_en_us "I patch people up. A bandage stops bleeding. Anything worse, come to me before it gets worse."
     Comment "Pack patch of the role_medic dialogue's line what (voiced; tools/assets/dialogue/role_medic_everon). Changing it needs: tools\\cli asset dialogue role_medic_everon"
    }
    CustomStringTableItem "{025CD7558F816299}" {
     Id "LF-Dialogue_RoleMedicEveron_Where"
     Target_en_us "If you need a bandage and I am not here, the general store keeps dressings by the counter."
     Comment "Pack patch of the role_medic dialogue's line where (voiced; tools/assets/dialogue/role_medic_everon). Changing it needs: tools\\cli asset dialogue role_medic_everon"
    }
    CustomStringTableItem "{8F41F510FD79F3BE}" {
     Id "LF-Dialogue_RolePoliceEveron_Bye"
     Target_en_us "Stay out of trouble."
     Comment "Pack patch of the role_police dialogue's line bye (voiced; tools/assets/dialogue/role_police_everon). Changing it needs: tools\\cli asset dialogue role_police_everon"
    }
    CustomStringTableItem "{9A27AA3E50F306D1}" {
     Id "LF-Dialogue_RolePoliceEveron_Greet"
     Target_en_us "Officer on duty. Keep your hands where I can see them, and we will get along."
     Comment "Pack patch of the role_police dialogue's line greet (voiced; tools/assets/dialogue/role_police_everon). Changing it needs: tools\\cli asset dialogue role_police_everon"
    }
    CustomStringTableItem "{967DB6575C46452A}" {
     Id "LF-Dialogue_RolePoliceEveron_Rumour"
     Target_en_us "We have had burglaries along the main street. If you saw anything, tell us. People here remember faces."
     Comment "Pack patch of the role_police dialogue's line rumour (voiced; tools/assets/dialogue/role_police_everon). Changing it needs: tools\\cli asset dialogue role_police_everon"
    }
    CustomStringTableItem "{9C6A57BC1C12EAD7}" {
     Id "LF-Dialogue_RolePoliceEveron_What"
     Target_en_us "I keep the peace and take the reports. Break into a shop or hurt someone and you will see me again."
     Comment "Pack patch of the role_police dialogue's line what (voiced; tools/assets/dialogue/role_police_everon). Changing it needs: tools\\cli asset dialogue role_police_everon"
    }
    CustomStringTableItem "{4DA989F1CE07B4FF}" {
     Id "LF-Dialogue_RolePoliceEveron_Where"
     Target_en_us "The station is the building behind me. The town board on the square lists everything else."
     Comment "Pack patch of the role_police dialogue's line where (voiced; tools/assets/dialogue/role_police_everon). Changing it needs: tools\\cli asset dialogue role_police_everon"
    }
    CustomStringTableItem "{51B71393FDAEED91}" {
     Id "LF-Dialogue_RoleStoreClerkEveron_Bye"
     Target_en_us "Take care out there."
     Comment "Pack patch of the role_store_clerk dialogue's line bye (voiced; tools/assets/dialogue/role_store_clerk_everon). Changing it needs: tools\\cli asset dialogue role_store_clerk_everon"
    }
    CustomStringTableItem "{C98A7F721A106860}" {
     Id "LF-Dialogue_RoleStoreClerkEveron_Greet"
     Target_en_us "Morning. Looking for something in particular?"
     Comment "Pack patch of the role_store_clerk dialogue's line greet (voiced; tools/assets/dialogue/role_store_clerk_everon). Changing it needs: tools\\cli asset dialogue role_store_clerk_everon"
    }
    CustomStringTableItem "{0215CA6A6B741C18}" {
     Id "LF-Dialogue_RoleStoreClerkEveron_Rumour"
     Target_en_us "Somebody has been asking whether I keep a safe under the counter. I do not, and I do not keep much cash either."
     Comment "Pack patch of the role_store_clerk dialogue's line rumour (voiced; tools/assets/dialogue/role_store_clerk_everon). Changing it needs: tools\\cli asset dialogue role_store_clerk_everon"
    }
    CustomStringTableItem "{8F9FDD48805CB8BF}" {
     Id "LF-Dialogue_RoleStoreClerkEveron_What"
     Target_en_us "I run the till and keep the shelves full. Bread, water, apples, dressings. If we do not have it, nobody in Saint-Philippe does."
     Comment "Pack patch of the role_store_clerk dialogue's line what (voiced; tools/assets/dialogue/role_store_clerk_everon). Changing it needs: tools\\cli asset dialogue role_store_clerk_everon"
    }
    CustomStringTableItem "{7312DDC94F510140}" {
     Id "LF-Dialogue_RoleStoreClerkEveron_Where"
     Target_en_us "The market square is south of the main street if you want fruit and vegetables. Cars are sold at the lot on the east side."
     Comment "Pack patch of the role_store_clerk dialogue's line where (voiced; tools/assets/dialogue/role_store_clerk_everon). Changing it needs: tools\\cli asset dialogue role_store_clerk_everon"
    }
    CustomStringTableItem "{28ACD8C672C3DF1F}" {
     Id "LF-Dialogue_RoleTellerEveron_Bye"
     Target_en_us "Good day. Mind your money."
     Comment "Pack patch of the role_teller dialogue's line bye (voiced; tools/assets/dialogue/role_teller_everon). Changing it needs: tools\\cli asset dialogue role_teller_everon"
    }
    CustomStringTableItem "{3D7A56C4F7C78DF9}" {
     Id "LF-Dialogue_RoleTellerEveron_Greet"
     Target_en_us "Good day. Welcome to the bank. How can I help?"
     Comment "Pack patch of the role_teller dialogue's line greet (voiced; tools/assets/dialogue/role_teller_everon). Changing it needs: tools\\cli asset dialogue role_teller_everon"
    }
    CustomStringTableItem "{D9601826DEA9607D}" {
     Id "LF-Dialogue_RoleTellerEveron_Rumour"
     Target_en_us "A man with no work and a drill in his bag asked me about the vault. I told him the vault is none of my business."
     Comment "Pack patch of the role_teller dialogue's line rumour (voiced; tools/assets/dialogue/role_teller_everon). Changing it needs: tools\\cli asset dialogue role_teller_everon"
    }
    CustomStringTableItem "{606DF12C454471D4}" {
     Id "LF-Dialogue_RoleTellerEveron_What"
     Target_en_us "I keep the counter and the accounts. Cash in your pocket is gone when you die. Money in the bank is not. The cash machine on the wall does deposits and withdrawals."
     Comment "Pack patch of the role_teller dialogue's line what (voiced; tools/assets/dialogue/role_teller_everon). Changing it needs: tools\\cli asset dialogue role_teller_everon"
    }
    CustomStringTableItem "{757C62BFEECAE52F}" {
     Id "LF-Dialogue_RoleTellerEveron_Where"
     Target_en_us "The post office is right beside us. The town board on the square lists the rest, and the police station is a short walk up the street."
     Comment "Pack patch of the role_teller dialogue's line where (voiced; tools/assets/dialogue/role_teller_everon). Changing it needs: tools\\cli asset dialogue role_teller_everon"
    }
    CustomStringTableItem "{66E02E6DC2FB7862}" {
     Id "LF-Dialogue_RoleTownsfolkEveron_Bye"
     Target_en_us "Take care."
     Comment "Pack patch of the role_townsfolk dialogue's line bye (voiced; tools/assets/dialogue/role_townsfolk_everon). Changing it needs: tools\\cli asset dialogue role_townsfolk_everon"
    }
    CustomStringTableItem "{B7EDB54EB5DF8CE9}" {
     Id "LF-Dialogue_RoleTownsfolkEveron_Greet"
     Target_en_us "Hello. New in Saint-Philippe?"
     Comment "Pack patch of the role_townsfolk dialogue's line greet (voiced; tools/assets/dialogue/role_townsfolk_everon). Changing it needs: tools\\cli asset dialogue role_townsfolk_everon"
    }
    CustomStringTableItem "{106848E394340C2B}" {
     Id "LF-Dialogue_RoleTownsfolkEveron_Rumour"
     Target_en_us "People say the police are watching the main street. Burglars are about. Keep your doors locked."
     Comment "Pack patch of the role_townsfolk dialogue's line rumour (voiced; tools/assets/dialogue/role_townsfolk_everon). Changing it needs: tools\\cli asset dialogue role_townsfolk_everon"
    }
    CustomStringTableItem "{47312B84FDA54AF0}" {
     Id "LF-Dialogue_RoleTownsfolkEveron_What"
     Target_en_us "I live here. I get by, as everyone does. The work is simple and the people are decent."
     Comment "Pack patch of the role_townsfolk dialogue's line what (voiced; tools/assets/dialogue/role_townsfolk_everon). Changing it needs: tools\\cli asset dialogue role_townsfolk_everon"
    }
    CustomStringTableItem "{57D2422ADB1BD399}" {
     Id "LF-Dialogue_RoleTownsfolkEveron_Where"
     Target_en_us "The town board on the square shows everything. The post office hires couriers, and the bank is beside it."
     Comment "Pack patch of the role_townsfolk dialogue's line where (voiced; tools/assets/dialogue/role_townsfolk_everon). Changing it needs: tools\\cli asset dialogue role_townsfolk_everon"
    }
    CustomStringTableItem "{3441F00000000001}" {
     Id "LF-Dialogue_Rumour_SayAsk"
     Target_en_us "Any talk in the cafe lately?"
     Comment "Reply: ask the café owner what the town is saying about the shipment (#3441)."
    }
    CustomStringTableItem "{3804F10000000008}" {
     Id "LF-Dialogue_ShipmentGoBetween_Bye"
     Target_en_us "Mind how you go."
     Comment "Hugo Valmy's goodbye (#3804)."
    }
    CustomStringTableItem "{3804F10000000003}" {
     Id "LF-Dialogue_ShipmentGoBetween_Greet"
     Target_en_us "Hugo Valmy. I help people who have more than they need meet people who need more than they have. Sit if you like, the coffee is honest, but I do not talk business with a face I do not know."
     Comment "Hugo Valmy's greeting, which also says who he is (#3804). Captions only until the voices card (#3444) records him."
    }
    CustomStringTableItem "{3804F1000000000D}" {
     Id "LF-Dialogue_ShipmentGoBetween_SayBye"
     Target_en_us "Goodbye."
     Comment "Reply: end the talk with Hugo Valmy (#3804)."
    }
    CustomStringTableItem "{3804F1000000000A}" {
     Id "LF-Dialogue_ShipmentGoBetween_SayCrate"
     Target_en_us "I opened the red crate on the quay."
     Comment "Reply: tell Hugo Valmy about the crate (#3804)."
    }
    CustomStringTableItem "{3804F1000000000B}" {
     Id "LF-Dialogue_ShipmentGoBetween_SayReported"
     Target_en_us "I took what was in the crate to the police."
     Comment "Reply: tell Hugo Valmy the sample was reported (#3804)."
    }
    CustomStringTableItem "{3804F1000000000C}" {
     Id "LF-Dialogue_ShipmentGoBetween_SaySold"
     Target_en_us "I found a buyer for what was in the crate."
     Comment "Reply: tell Hugo Valmy the sample was sold (#3804)."
    }
    CustomStringTableItem "{3804F10000000005}" {
     Id "LF-Dialogue_ShipmentGoBetween_Sell"
     Target_en_us "So you opened the red crate. If you still have what was in it, I know a buyer: cash on the spot, no questions. He keeps to the lanes and the quay after dark. The police will only thank you."
     Comment "Hugo Valmy introduces the sell ending of the shipment; he never names the buyer's spot, the buyer rotates (#3804)."
    }
    CustomStringTableItem "{3804F10000000006}" {
     Id "LF-Dialogue_ShipmentGoBetween_Sold"
     Target_en_us "Then we have never met, and you have never seen the red crate. A pleasure doing no business with you."
     Comment "Hugo Valmy reacts to a player who sold the sample (#3804)."
    }
    CustomStringTableItem "{3804F10000000007}" {
     Id "LF-Dialogue_ShipmentGoBetween_Threat"
     Target_en_us "You walked it to the desk. Fine. Mind the coast road at night, friend. It is long, and it is short of lamps."
     Comment "Hugo Valmy's one threat to a player who reported the sample (#3804)."
    }
    CustomStringTableItem "{C11DD24E98D1CC8F}" {
     Id "LF-Dialogue_ShopkeeperEveron_Bye"
     Target_en_us "Good day to you."
     Comment "Pack patch of the shopkeeper dialogue's line bye (voiced; tools/assets/dialogue/shopkeeper_everon). Changing it needs: tools\\cli asset dialogue shopkeeper_everon"
    }
    CustomStringTableItem "{1D0D875C11AF5BC7}" {
     Id "LF-Dialogue_ShopkeeperEveron_Greet"
     Target_en_us "Good day. Take what you need from the shelves and pay at the till."
     Comment "Pack patch of the shopkeeper dialogue's line greet (voiced; tools/assets/dialogue/shopkeeper_everon). Changing it needs: tools\\cli asset dialogue shopkeeper_everon"
    }
    CustomStringTableItem "{F2961FC39BBF511A}" {
     Id "LF-Dialogue_ShopkeeperEveron_HowToPay"
     Target_en_us "Pick the goods up yourself, then pay at any till before you leave. You get a receipt. Walk out without paying and the alarm goes off."
     Comment "Pack patch of the shopkeeper dialogue's line how_to_pay (voiced; tools/assets/dialogue/shopkeeper_everon). Changing it needs: tools\\cli asset dialogue shopkeeper_everon"
    }
    CustomStringTableItem "{48A3FBB00A316BF1}" {
     Id "LF-Dialogue_ShopkeeperEveron_Stock"
     Target_en_us "Food and household goods on the shelves, drinks in the chilled counter. What runs out comes back from the stockroom every few minutes."
     Comment "Pack patch of the shopkeeper dialogue's line stock (voiced; tools/assets/dialogue/shopkeeper_everon). Changing it needs: tools\\cli asset dialogue shopkeeper_everon"
    }
    CustomStringTableItem "{18E74673B9BA1239}" {
     Id "LF-Dialogue_ShopkeeperEveron_Thief"
     Target_en_us "Stop! You did not pay for that! Come back here!"
     Comment "Pack patch of the shopkeeper dialogue's line thief (voiced; tools/assets/dialogue/shopkeeper_everon). Changing it needs: tools\\cli asset dialogue shopkeeper_everon"
    }
    CustomStringTableItem "{F2B1DF023C756490}" {
     Id "LF-Everon-Lock_Closed"
     Target_en_us "Closed"
     Comment "Door prompt on the harbour company offices (#3204)."
    }
    CustomStringTableItem "{7D3A91C2E54B08F6}" {
     Id "LF-Everon-Lock_ForSale"
     Target_en_us "For sale: see the sign"
     Comment "Door prompt on a home for sale whose house marker is in the world and nobody owns yet (#3584); once bought it shows Lock_Private to everyone but the owner and key holders."
    }
    CustomStringTableItem "{04E0632F53FEF329}" {
     Id "LF-Everon-Lock_ForSaleSoon"
     Target_en_us "For sale soon"
     Comment "Door prompt on a home that no sale card has opened yet (#3204); the house marker wins once it does."
    }
    CustomStringTableItem "{FB53912C7C2A947B}" {
     Id "LF-Everon-Lock_Military"
     Target_en_us "Military zone"
